&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note: We are not able to consider candidates who are not living and working in the Netherlands. At this moment we are not providing relocation sponsorships.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;Build the fundament for our Azure Services&lt;/blockquote&gt;
