&lt;p&gt;In our central Services&amp;nbsp;we&amp;nbsp;design,&amp;nbsp;build,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;reusable digital platforms&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;digitals assets&amp;nbsp;that empower our customer teams. One of&amp;nbsp;them is&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;Cloud&amp;nbsp;Enablement&amp;nbsp;Platform: a set of standardized, secure, and opinionated&amp;nbsp;building blocks and services needed to&amp;nbsp;successfully service a cloud environment&amp;nbsp;used&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;many customers and environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Azure Platform Engineer, you work in this Services team and help shape and evolve the codebase for these platforms, services, and assets. You engage actively with our engineering community to&amp;nbsp;shape&amp;nbsp;the roadmap and collaborate with customer teams to ensure platform improvements are adopted and proven in real-world, production environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
