&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We are looking for an AWS Platform Engineer who enjoys building and improving platform capabilities, enabling development teams, and taking responsibility for the systems they create and operate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
