&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Work with reusable components such as monitoring, backup, and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Contribute during the assessment phase and transition into implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
