&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5601&quot; data-local-id=&quot;40e0e1f3f1fb&quot;&gt;The opportunity is broader than modernizing individual systems or automating existing processes. We believe AI will fundamentally change how our corporate functions contribute to the firm, and realizing that will mean redesigning important workflows from the ground up, establishing stronger foundations in data and technology, and creating new ways for business and engineering teams to work together. This is not about applying AI to inefficient processes and leaving them intact. It is about simplifying the underlying workflows so that people, data, software and agents can work together effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
